fastlane beta


##  Upload Appstore Screenshots
 - If a language has been added :
   - retrieve the country code (See: Upload Appstore Metadata)
   - Update script ascreenshots.sh to handle the new language
 - ./scripts/screenshots.sh 
 - fastlane store_screenshots


##  Upload Appstore Metadata
 - Add release not for specific version in fastlane/AppStoreMetadata.xcstrings>release_notes.x.x.x
 - If a language has been added :
   - retrieve the country code by fetching metadata : fastlane deliver download_metadata
   - Update script appstore_metadata.sh to handle the new language
 - translate AppStoreMetadata.xcstrings
 - fastlane metadata
